ll,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["其實整體應該是可以給到四顆星，因為店員熱情、餐飲味道不錯，但是場地實在是太扣分了。\n\n在這個隨便破三十幾度的天氣，吃熱食湯麵真的很需要強大的冷氣，可是在外面機台點完餐後，推開門的那一刻真的好想逃跑啊！\n\n室內不僅燠熱且超級悶，混合著炙燒的油氣，整個空間是不舒服的。\n\n說回食物，限定新品蔥油芝麻的那款滿順口的，麻辣口味如果是不喜歡辣油渣味道的人應該會覺得不太好吃。\n\n肉品的話舒肥雞口感›叉燒，蛋也入味好吃。甜品的話，配料有點少，有的料裝完了可能會換成其他的料，不過豆花還是很值得一吃，爽口細滑的很讚。\n\n－－－－\n\n⭐　想到就顫慄！／你印度級了！／錢被刮去黑洞了💸\n⭐⭐　老闆，我們是人，敲敲～～\n⭐⭐⭐　不好不壞，中規中矩，感謝天🙂\n⭐⭐⭐⭐　粗美／一週可食兩次／有特色\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐　老闆根本食神（👍👍👍）／佛心公司（粗美級好吃＋CP值）",null,[0,100]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12665254042797322966/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTTTFJd1VtdFZNVGxJWkd4V2VWcElSbmxPTUdobVVXdFNhV0pzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12665254042797322966/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTTTFJd1VtdFZNVGxJWkd4V2VWcElSbmxPTUdobVVXdFNhV0pzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12665254042797322966/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTTTFJd1VtdFZNVGxJWkd4V2VWcElSbmxPTUdobVVXdFNhV0pzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12665254042797322966/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTTTFJd1VtdFZNVGxJWkd4V2VWcElSbmxPTUdobVVXdFNhV0pzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12665254042797322966/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTTTFJd1VtdFZNVGxJWkd4V2VWcElSbmxPTUdobVVXdFNhV0pzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12665254042797322966/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFTTTFJd1VtdFZNVGxJWkd4V2VWcElSbmxPTUdobVVXdFNhV0pzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,11785,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SM1IwUmtVMTlIZGxWeVpIRnlOMGhmUWtSaWJsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xcabb6bd76a0ba2fd!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmR3R0RkU19HdlVyZHFyN0hfQkRiblE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNv